<div className={styles.pvlRoot}>
	<div class="py-5"></div>
	<div class="py-5"></div>
	<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><h2 style="text-align: center;">Sponsor a Red Kettle in Greenville</h2>
<p>Businesses and civic organizations, sponsor a Red Kettle in Greenville this Christmas, and help support our mission all year long. Learn more about our Matching Program below. Contact <a href="mailto://justin.heisey@uss.salvationarmy.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Justin Heisey </a>to sponsor a Red Kettle.</p></div>
	<div class="py-5"></div>
	<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><p><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="https://8hxvw8tw.media.zestyio.com/Matching-Kettle-Flyer.jpg" alt="Matching-Kettle-Flyer.jpg"></p></div>
	<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><h2 style="text-align: center;">Donate to the Red Kettle Impact Campaign</h2>
<p>Your donation stays in Greenville to help us support those in need all year long.</p>
<p><a href="https://fundraise.givesmart.com/form/LgV9yg?vid=1syo97" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://8hxvw8tw.media.zestyio.com/Untitled-design-2.HJQrSUFiGg.png" alt="Untitled-design-2.HJQrSUFiGg.png"></a></p></div>
	<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><h2 style="text-align: center;">Volunteer with the Red Kettle Impact Campaign</h2>
<p>Grab your group and sign up to ring the bells to raise money for The Salvation Army of Greenville this Christmas! <strong><a href="https://volunteer.southern.salvationarmyusa.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Click here</a></strong> and sort volunteer opportunities by your zip code.</p>
<p><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="https://8hxvw8tw.media.zestyio.com/592656990_1255727066588369_2210849369025258786_n.jpg" alt="592656990_1255727066588369_2210849369025258786_n.jpg" width="195" height="261"></p></div>
	<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><h2 style="text-align: center;">Angel Tree Greenville</h2>
<p>Visit our <a href="https://www.salvationarmyusa.org/usa-southern-territory/north-and-south-carolina/greenville-sc-area-command/greenville-county-sc-angel-tree/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Angel Tree page</a> to learn more about how you can help support Greenville families in need at Christmas.</p>
<p><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="https://8hxvw8tw.media.zestyio.com/DSC01071.rkLVus8sMe.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=400" alt="DSC01071.rkLVus8sMe.jpg" width="1200" height="400"></p></div>
